### Prevention Checklist

Before writing useAuth-dependent tests:
- [ ] Use explicit module mock: `jest.mock('@/hooks/useAuth', () => ({ useAuth: jest.fn() }))`
- [ ] Import actual TypeScript interfaces for proper typing
- [ ] Use correct UserSession data structure (numbers for IDs, not strings)
- [ ] Include all required auth context properties in mock
- [ ] Clear mocks in beforeEach to prevent test interference
- [ ] Avoid `as any` type assertions to satisfy linters

